# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
#
# tests/container/Containerfile - isolated Wayland compositor for any
# test that touches the leader's surface: keyboard, mouse or screen
# (GODS_LAWS.md L-09, TEST-WLCONT). The container is the outer
# boundary; the compositor lives INSIDE it, on a socket the host never
# shares. Nothing in this image, and nothing in the `docker run`
# invocation that starts it, may reach back into the host session -
# see check_isolation.sh for the proof.
#
# Pinned on fedora:44, the primary target (GODS_LAWS.md L-04): this
# gate has to fail exactly when the leader's own machine would fail,
# never drift to a moving `:latest`.
#
# kwin is the compositor by the leader's own registered decision
# (CLAUDE.md, "Isolamento obrigatório de teste"; GODS_LAWS.md L-09) -
# not weston, not sway, not labwc, and never an X11 framebuffer server
# (GODS_LAWS.md L-05: the prohibited term itself is spelled out in
# GODS_LAWS.md and in tests/tools/check_no_x11.sh's own pattern, never
# here - this comment would fail its own gate otherwise, see L-40).
# `--virtual` renders to a software framebuffer,
# which is why mesa-dri-drivers (llvmpipe) is here and /dev/dri is
# not: L-09 rule 4 says no real GPU device by default, precisely so
# this image renders the same way on every runner in the CI matrix.
#
# ARCH-PORTS, TDD case R4: a SECOND, throwaway build stage compiles
# connect_smoke.cpp against the REAL wayland_display_adapter/err.cpp/
# err_code.cpp production sources - staged here by
# prepare_arch_ports_fixture.sh (run BEFORE `docker build`, see
# .github/workflows/ci.yml's own "wayland-container" job, and that
# script's own header comment for why the docker build CONTEXT stays
# tests/container/, never the repository root). Two stages, not one:
# gcc-c++/wayland-devel never need to exist in the FINAL image this
# project runs the compositor from - only the resulting static-linked
# binary does, kept lean the same way a multi-stage container build
# normally trims a toolchain out of a runtime image.
#
# WL-DISPLAY fatia B, TDD case B: registry_smoke.cpp is built in this
# SAME stage, against the SAME staged sources (now also global_
# catalog.hpp/.cpp - see prepare_arch_ports_fixture.sh's own header
# comment) - one extra `g++` invocation, same flags, same fixture.
#
# WL-DISPLAY fatia C, TDD case C: fatal_error_smoke.cpp, same shape
# again - `-pthread` added because it uses std::this_thread::sleep_for
# (glibc's own libstdc++ threading facilities need it linked even for
# the non-thread-creating half of <thread>).
#
# WL-DISPLAY fatia D, TDD case D: pump_smoke.cpp, same shape again.
#
# WL-WINDOW fatia W-B (docs/plano-w6a-janela.md fatia 5): shell_smoke.cpp,
# same staged-sources shape again, plus wayland-protocols-devel (the
# xdg-shell.xml this stage's own wayland-scanner invocation below turns
# into a client header + private-code .c, the SAME two-artifact split
# cmake/GlintfxWaylandProtocols.cmake performs for the real library
# build - GODS_LAWS.md L-07: read from the SYSTEM package, never
# vendored).
#
# WL-WINDOW fatia W-E (docs/plano-w6a-janela.md fatia 8): window_smoke.cpp,
# same staged-sources shape again, plus window_adapter.cpp/window_
# configure_sequence.cpp (src/platform/wayland/) and the three OS-
# agnostic src/platform/window/ files (window_state.cpp, window_desc_
# validation.cpp, utf8_validation.cpp) - the ONE fixture in this whole
# image that goes on to attach a real wl_shm buffer and commit it
# (D-W5-9), which is what turns a REMOVED ack_configure() inside
# wayland_window_adapter into an actual protocol error instead of a
# silent no-op (this fixture's own header comment). APOSENTADO por
# GL-CONTEXT fatia 5 (docs/plano-w6b-fatias-5.md, D-W6b-12), depois das
# cinco mutações obrigatórias provadas contra egl_protocol_error_smoke.
# cpp abaixo terem reprovado como esperado: a API pública ganhou, nesta
# mesma fatia, um jeito de anexar conteúdo real (gltfx_gl_context) e um
# fixture que reprova o MESMO ack_configure() removido através dela.
#
# WL-SEAT fatia S-B (docs/plano-w6a-janela.md fatia 12): seat_test.cpp,
# same staged-sources shape again, plus seat_adapter.cpp (src/platform/
# wayland/) and the OS-agnostic seat_capabilities.cpp (src/platform/
# input/) it writes into. Needs no xdg-shell binding at all - wl_seat
# is bound straight off the registry the same way wl_compositor/xdg_
# wm_base are, but this fixture never touches xdg_surface/xdg_toplevel.
#
# WL-WINDOW-HANDLE (docs/plano-w6a-janela.md fatias 6/9/11, absorbed by
# CTO decision into one fatia): window_parity_test.cpp, staged from
# tests/parity/ (not this directory - prepare_arch_ports_fixture.sh's
# own "the fixture source itself" comment explains why it needs
# staging too). FIRST fixture in this whole image to touch the PUBLIC
# API (glintfx::gltfx_display/gltfx_window) instead of an internal
# adapter directly - built against display_facade.cpp/window_
# facade.cpp (the two TUs that actually define display_impl/window_
# impl) plus every source window_smoke.cpp above already needs, same
# staged sources, same xdg-shell binding. Same shared-name mechanism as
# two_displays_test above: tests/CMakeLists.txt (if(WIN32)) registers a
# normal ctest, linked against the PACKAGED glintfx::glintfx target,
# under this EXACT name from this SAME source file (tests/parity/
# window_parity_test.cpp) - this fixture is the Linux side of that same
# P-0 pair, never a second source.
#
# WIN-WINDOW fatia 7 (X-1', docs/plano-w6a-janela.md, "Prova Linux"
# column: "two_displays_test (container, dois displays abertos no
# mesmo processo)"; sec. 5 item 8): two_displays_test.cpp, same staged-
# sources shape as registry_smoke.cpp above (display_adapter.cpp/
# global_catalog.cpp only, no shell/seat/window sources needed) - the
# Linux-side witness that a SECOND wayland_display_adapter, opened in
# the SAME process, does not collide with or corrupt the first. NAMED
# "two_displays_test", not a per-platform prefix, exactly like seat_
# test.cpp above and registry_smoke.cpp's own header comment already
# explains for that reason: this is the SHARED ctest name tests/two_
# displays_test.cpp (Windows, tests/CMakeLists.txt if(WIN32)) already
# registers under, so tests/tools/check_test_parity.py's P-0 inventory
# lines the two up under one name.
# GL-CONTEXT fatia 1 (docs/plano-w6b-placa-e-laco.md, G-1, D-W6b-3):
# egl_probe_smoke.cpp, same staged-sources shape as window_smoke.cpp
# above (it reuses window_smoke's EXACT source set - it opens the same
# kind of glintfx window, only over it does it go on to ask EGL/GL a
# question window_smoke never asks) - no NEW production source needed
# in tests/container/_arch_ports_src/ (prepare_arch_ports_fixture.sh
# stages src/, include/ and tests/parity/ in full, 06/09/2026 - what
# this binary links against is whatever the `g++` invocation below
# names, never a separate list this script would have to keep in sync).
# mesa-libEGL-devel is the ONE new package this build stage needs (it
# pulls libglvnd-devel, which owns both <EGL/egl.h>/<EGL/eglext.h> and
# egl.pc on this distro - measured via `rpm -qf`/`rpm -q --requires`
# before writing this line, GODS_LAWS.md L-44): wayland-devel (already
# installed below) already carries <wayland-egl.h> and wayland-egl.pc,
# so no second new package is needed for that half.
#
# GL-CONTEXT fatia 5, P-GL (docs/plano-w6b-fatias-5.md, D-W6b-29):
# gl_context_parity_test.cpp, staged from tests/parity/ (same reason
# window_parity_test.cpp above needs staging) - the gemeo of that same
# fixture one layer up, ONLY the PUBLIC API (glintfx::gltfx_gl_context),
# built against every source window_parity_test.cpp already needs plus
# egl_context_adapter.cpp/connection_failure.cpp/frame_callback_
# sequence.cpp/gl_context_facade.cpp and the six OS-agnostic src/
# platform/gl/ atoms (gfx_option_registry, gfx_option_validation,
# gfx_open_only_fixation, gl_context_desc_validation, gl_version_
# policy, gl_surface_size_policy) - wayland-egl/egl cflags/libs added
# to this ONE invocation (window_parity_test's own does not need them).
#
# egl_protocol_error_smoke.cpp, staged straight from THIS directory
# (tests/container/ - the build context, same as window_smoke.cpp
# above, never from _arch_ports_src): the PERMANENT proof of D-W6b-28
# (connection_failure.cpp's own build_connection_failure() naming the
# real interface a dead wl_display carries), over adaptadores internos
# directly (wayland_display_adapter/wayland_shell_adapter/wayland_
# window_adapter/wayland_egl_context_adapter) - same source set as
# gl_context_parity_test's own EGL half, minus the two window/display
# facade TUs it never needs (it never touches the public API).
FROM fedora:44 AS arch-ports-builder
RUN dnf -y install gcc-c++ pkgconf-pkg-config wayland-devel wayland-protocols-devel mesa-libEGL-devel \
    && dnf clean all
COPY _arch_ports_src /build/_arch_ports_src
COPY connect_smoke.cpp /build/connect_smoke.cpp
COPY registry_smoke.cpp /build/registry_smoke.cpp
COPY fatal_error_smoke.cpp /build/fatal_error_smoke.cpp
COPY pump_smoke.cpp /build/pump_smoke.cpp
COPY shell_smoke.cpp /build/shell_smoke.cpp
COPY window_smoke.cpp /build/window_smoke.cpp
COPY egl_probe_smoke.cpp /build/egl_probe_smoke.cpp
COPY egl_protocol_error_smoke.cpp /build/egl_protocol_error_smoke.cpp
COPY seat_test.cpp /build/seat_test.cpp
COPY two_displays_test.cpp /build/two_displays_test.cpp
COPY facade_pin_smoke.cpp /build/facade_pin_smoke.cpp
COPY window_active_after_map_smoke.cpp /build/window_active_after_map_smoke.cpp
RUN wayland-scanner client-header \
        "$(pkg-config --variable=pkgdatadir wayland-protocols)/stable/xdg-shell/xdg-shell.xml" \
        /build/xdg-shell-client-protocol.h \
    && wayland-scanner private-code \
        "$(pkg-config --variable=pkgdatadir wayland-protocols)/stable/xdg-shell/xdg-shell.xml" \
        /build/xdg-shell-protocol.c \
    && gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -c /build/xdg-shell-protocol.c -o /build/xdg-shell-protocol.o
RUN g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/arch_ports_connect_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/connect_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/registry_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/registry_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/two_displays_test \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/two_displays_test.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pthread \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/fatal_error_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/fatal_error_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/pump_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/pump_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src -I /build \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/shell_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_requirements.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/xdg-shell-protocol.o \
        /build/shell_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src -I /build \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/window_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_requirements.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_configure_sequence.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_state.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_desc_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/utf8_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/xdg-shell-protocol.o \
        /build/window_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src -I /build \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client wayland-egl egl) \
        -o /build/egl_probe_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_requirements.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_configure_sequence.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_state.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_desc_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/utf8_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/xdg-shell-protocol.o \
        /build/egl_probe_smoke.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client wayland-egl egl) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/seat_test \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/seat_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/input/seat_capabilities.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/seat_test.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src -I /build \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client) \
        -o /build/window_parity_test \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_requirements.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_configure_sequence.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_state.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_desc_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/utf8_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/display_facade.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_facade.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/xdg-shell-protocol.o \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/tests/parity/window_parity_test.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src -I /build \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client wayland-egl egl) \
        -o /build/gl_context_parity_test \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_requirements.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_configure_sequence.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_state.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_desc_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/utf8_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/display_facade.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_facade.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_context_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_device_query.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/drm_device_facts.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/drm_gpu_kind.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_device_dedup.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_device_enumeration.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gpu_kind_exclusion.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gl_memory_facts.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/memory_separation_kind.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/frame_callback_sequence.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gl_version_policy.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gl_surface_size_policy.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gl_context_facade.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gpu_enumeration_facade.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gfx_option_registry.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gfx_option_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gfx_open_only_fixation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gl_context_desc_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/core/err_code.cpp \
        /build/xdg-shell-protocol.o \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/tests/parity/gl_context_parity_test.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --libs wayland-client wayland-egl egl) \
    && g++ -std=c++23 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror \
        -I /build/_arch_ports_src/include -I /build/_arch_ports_src/src -I /build \
        $(pkg-config --cflags wayland-client wayland-egl egl) \
        -o /build/egl_protocol_error_smoke \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/display_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/global_catalog.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_requirements.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/shell_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_configure_sequence.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_state.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/window_desc_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/window/utf8_validation.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/window_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/connection_failure.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_context_adapter.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_device_query.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/drm_device_facts.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/drm_gpu_kind.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_device_dedup.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/wayland/egl_device_enumeration.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gpu_kind_exclusion.cpp \
        /build/_arch_ports_src/src/platform/gl/gl_memory_facts.cpp \
